smoothmotion-android
Copyright 2026 Ivorisnoob

Built for Koda (https://github.com/Ivorisnoob/Koda), where the engine is
developed and shipped as "Smooth motion".

This product includes a port of open-svpflow
(https://github.com/Z1xus/open-svpflow, commit a334f02), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0: the frame renderer, its coverage and bad-area
masks, scene classification and phase re-timing in ComputeMotionEngine.kt.
open-svpflow is an independent reimplementation of SVPFlow, the VapourSynth
plugins of SmoothVideo Project (SVP). No code from SVP itself is included.
